          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "- First glass objects: small (1) ______ made in Mesopotamia about 4,500 years ago"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "- Probably discovered by accident when sand was heated near a (2) ______"
